Applies to the result artefacts in `data/`: the JSON records of the reported campaigns and the
generated LaTeX table, plus the three Abaqus `.dat` result files.

The code is under the MIT licence; see LICENSE.

CalculiX (`ccx`) is a separate work, distributed by its own authors under the GNU General Public
License. This repository neither includes nor modifies it: it invokes an installed binary.

Note on the Abaqus result files. `data/exp1_abaqus_axial661.dat`, `data/exp1_abaqus_combined661.dat`
and `data/exp29_abaqus_freq661.dat` are outputs of Abaqus, produced on the deck this bundle
generates. They are included so that the commercial side of the validation table can be read
without an Abaqus licence.
